{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國材料科學研究院（KIMS）科研團隊近日開發出一種安裝於汽車前格柵內部的新型空氣淨化系統，該技術能夠在車輛行駛過程中主動收集空氣中的顆粒物，尤其針對剎車系統產生的粉塵污染進行處理，有望幫助降低道路交通帶來的空氣質素問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584166.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:02:08.181649+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:45:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_hash":"0e5742606b2bbf3bba7f2b51a3258cd3e59520be6c549ea1a8135102a47d478b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}